Packet parsing details (OpenPGP, RFC 4880):
- Packet header: first byte bit7=1. bit6=1 → new format: tag = byte & 0x3F; length: 1-octet (<192), 2-octet (192..223: ((b-192)<<8)+b2+192), 5-octet (255 + 4-byte length), partial (224..254: 1<<(b&0x1f)).
